      "font_size": 9.963,
      "raw_text": "Website Fingerprinting (WF) attacks allow high base pages (such as the most popular search engines), as our open-world website (OWF), this work achieves the first scalable to explicitly include the base rate, allowing us to",
      "extractor": "pypdf_fallback"
